    ('2197a6f8-2b78-71e4-81c1-b7b6a744ece4',
     'MAGGIC-MLP: Federated 1-Year Mortality Risk Prediction in Chronic Heart Failure',
     'Retrospective multi-centre study that develops MAGGIC-MLP, a neural network predicting 1-year all-cause mortality in adults with chronic heart failure from the 13 MAGGIC risk-score predictors. The model is trained with federated learning across two clinical partners in the Netherlands, Amsterdam UMC and UMCU (University Medical Center Utrecht): each site trains on its own EHR extraction, and only model updates and aggregate statistics leave the site. Version 1.0 was deployed in October 2025; version 2.0 was retrained in April 2026 after deployment monitoring reported prediction drift.',
     '1) Develop a calibrated multi-layer perceptron that predicts 1-year all-cause mortality from the MAGGIC predictors. 2) Compare its discrimination and calibration with the original MAGGIC integer risk score. 3) Report performance separately for each clinical partner, monitor it after deployment, and retrain when drift is detected.',
     'Approved on 2024-10-15 by the Medical Ethics Review Committee of Amsterdam UMC (application no. 234) as research not subject to the Dutch WMO, with local approval at UMCU. Individual informed consent was waived for this retrospective analysis of pseudonymised EHR data. Patient-level data does not leave the originating site.',
     'study_owner');

